  "text": "Skip to Main Content\nHome\nEvents\nGet Tickets\nMUSIC SOCIAL\nLeaves you\nbuzzing for days.\nEvery Wednesday · The Red Lion, Leytonstone\nMonthly Super Sundays · Across London\nSee all dates\nNext Social\nNEXT EVENT · WEDNESDAY\n14 October\nThe Red Lion, Leytonstone\nMidweek Social · 7-9pm\nSingle · £19\nGroup offer: Buy 4, get 1 free\nWant to stay up to date? Join the mailing list\nFeel the buzz\nOur inspiration: Grupo Menos é Mais, Coração Partido\nA room full of people playing and singing.\n \nThis is music at its most sociable:\na drink in one hand, a shaker in the other.\n \nShaped by our experiences playing and learning Brazilian music, Music Social is built to feel this good (with English songs).​​\n\"That was euphoric\"\n- Alicia, Soho Social\nGet Tickets\nFrequently Asked Questions\nQ. Do I need to be able to sing?\nA. Absolutely not.\nSHOW\nQ. What if I'm not \"musical\"?\nA. If you like music, you’re musical enough!\nSHOW\nQ. What if I can't play a musical instrument?\nA. You don’t have to play. But everyone can do so at a Music Social.\nSHOW\nQ. Is it weird if I come alone?\nA. Half our ticket holders come alone. It’s a big part of the magic.\nSHOW\nQ. Do I need to know the lyrics?\nA. No, we provide them.\nSHOW\nQ. Can I bring my instrument?\nA. You can bring an acoustic guitar but for anything else leave it at home and play our stuff.\nSHOW\nHear from our community\nDon't just take it from us! Check out what Gabi and Pedro have to say about Music Social events in London:\nNever miss a social\nFirst name\nEmail*\nI'd like to receive updates from Music Social. You can unsubscribe any time.*\nNotify me\nEvents\nhello@musicsocial.co.uk\n​\nPrivate Parties\n© 2025 Music Social",
